            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The decision limits Medicaid recipients\u2019 ability to enforce the free\u2011choice\u2011of\u2011provider provision through federal courts."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1d34a3b4a43cc3a02ee71c033327e3d8e3f94ea90e18bf1026df244ea2dbbcb8",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1d34a3b4a43c-0001-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "By narrowing the reach of \u00a71983, the ruling affects future challenges to federal spending\u2011power statutes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1d34a3b4a43cc3a02ee71c033327e3d8e3f94ea90e18bf1026df244ea2dbbcb8",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1d34a3b4a43c-0006-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 62,
              "start": 62
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Jackson, the dissent warns that the ruling could deprive Medicaid recipients of a meaningful way to enforce a right that Congress expressly granted."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1d34a3b4a43cc3a02ee71c033327e3d8e3f94ea90e18bf1026df244ea2dbbcb8",
            "evidence_ids": [
